[{"answer":"Sometimes my friends and I play a game.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/1.mp3"},{"answer":"It's something we made up, so it doesn't have a name.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/2.mp3"},{"answer":"We like to take words that rhyme.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/3.mp3"},{"answer":"We put them together line by line.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you get the picture now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/5.mp3"},{"answer":"We're playing the game, and this is how.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I might say I like to drive a car.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I really don't like to go very far.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/8.mp3"},{"answer":"If I decide to take a walk,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd go with a friend so that we could talk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you see that these lines rhyme?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Play the game if you have the time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/12.mp3"},{"answer":"We could talk about school or even playing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know what I am saying?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Rhyming words is easy to do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/15.mp3"},{"answer":"It's fun for me; it can be fun for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Just join in and say something.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Or make it into a song that you can sing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/18.mp3"},{"answer":"There are so many words that rhyme with others.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Like \"smile\" and \"mile\" and \"mothers\" and \"brothers\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I could spend all day just making up these things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I could let my imagination fly on wings","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Up to the clouds and back to my mind.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/23.mp3"},{"answer":"There are so many rhymes that I can find.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/24.mp3"},{"answer":"There are some words that are hard to find rhymes for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't use those words anymore.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I like to choose words that are easy to rhyme.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Like \"cat\" and \"bat\" or \"lime\" and \"time\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/28.mp3"},{"answer":"So give it a try, I know you'll have fun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll say \"goodbye,\" my rhyming is done.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/88-rhyming-words-2019-03-29-13-15-38/30.mp3"}]
